%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

We now address the question of repairing classical symmetric-key schemes which are vulnerable to Simon's algorithm. We begin with the simplest construction, the so-called Even-Mansour cipher~\cite{EM97}.

\subsection{Generalizing the Even-Mansour scheme}
